<% title = 'Generate Dummy Presensi & Jadwal Shift' %>
<%- include('../partials/header') %>

<p><a href="/dummy-data">&larr; Generate Dummy Data</a></p>
<h1>Generate Dummy Presensi &amp; Jadwal Shift</h1>
<p class="muted">
  Insert langsung (PERMANEN, bukan rollback) ke <code>tr_employeerequestpermissions</code> (izin sakit),
  <code>log_attendances</code> (presensi hadir), dan <code>ms_employeeshiftschedules</code> (jadwal shift/off)
  - khusus field off/long-shift/double-shift, cuma berlaku ke employee yang <code>is_shift = true</code>.
  Overtime request tidak dibuat di sini (form/alur terpisah).
</p>

<% if (result && result.error) { %>
  <div class="banner banner-error"><%= result.error %></div>
<% } %>
<% if (result && result.summary) { %>
  <div class="banner">Berhasil generate data utk <strong><%= result.summary.length %></strong> employee.</div>
  <table class="grid">
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Employee</th><th>Sakit</th><th>Abstain</th><th>Off</th><th>Long Shift</th><th>Double Shift (gap)</th><th>Hari Kerja</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <% result.summary.forEach(s => { %>
        <tr>
          <td><%= s.name %></td>
          <td><%= s.sick %></td>
          <td><%= s.abstain %></td>
          <td><%= s.off %></td>
          <td><%= s.longshift %></td>
          <td><%= s.gapshift %></td>
          <td><%= s.working %></td>
        </tr>
      <% }) %>
    </tbody>
  </table>
<% } %>

<form method="POST" action="/dummy-data/attendance-shift" class="form">
  <h3 class="form-section-title">Batch Target</h3>
  <div class="form-grid">
    <div class="form-row">
      <label>Company</label>
      <select name="company_id" id="company_id" required>
        <option value="">-- pilih company --</option>
        <% companies.forEach(c => { %>
          <option value="<%= c.id %>"><%= c.name %></option>
        <% }) %>
      </select>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-grid">
    <div class="form-row">
      <label>Shift (centang &ge;1 - tiap hari di-random pilih 1 dari yang dicentang, "1 hari maks 1 shift")</label>
      <div id="shift-checklist" class="employee-checklist">-- pilih company dulu --</div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <label>Employee (centang minimal 1 - badge "shift" nandain employee is_shift=true)</label>
      <div id="employee-checklist" class="employee-checklist">-- pilih company dulu --</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h3 class="form-section-title">Rentang Tanggal</h3>
  <div class="form-grid">
    <div class="form-row">
      <label>Tanggal Mulai</label>
      <input type="date" name="start_date" required>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <label>Tanggal Akhir</label>
      <input type="date" name="end_date" required>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h3 class="form-section-title">Presensi (berlaku semua employee, shift maupun reguler)</h3>
  <div class="form-grid">
    <div class="form-row">
      <label>Jumlah tidak hadir + izin sakit (approved)</label>
      <input type="number" name="sick_count" min="0" value="0">
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <label>Jumlah abstain (tanpa keterangan)</label>
      <input type="number" name="abstain_count" min="0" value="0">
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="muted section-hint">
    Sisa hari (di luar sakit &amp; abstain) otomatis di-generate presensi hadir normal (clock in/out).
  </p>

  <h3 class="form-section-title">Jadwal Shift (khusus employee is_shift = true)</h3>
  <div class="form-grid">
    <div class="form-row">
      <label>Jumlah hari Off</label>
      <input type="number" name="off_count" min="0" value="0">
    </div>
  </div>

  <h3 class="form-section-title">2 Shift dalam 1 Hari (khusus pola "Shift 1"/"Shift 2"/"Shift 3", by name)</h3>
  <div class="form-grid">
    <div class="form-row">
      <label>Jumlah hari Long Shift (Shift 1 &rarr; Shift 2, SATU presensi menerus)</label>
      <input type="number" name="longshift_count" min="0" value="0">
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <label>Long Shift - clock_out sampai</label>
      <div class="mode-row">
        <label><input type="radio" name="longshift_mode" value="full" checked> Full Shift 2 (sampai min_end_time)</label>
        <label><input type="radio" name="longshift_mode" value="hours"> Sebagian, masuk Shift 2 selama</label>
        <input type="number" name="longshift_hours" min="0" step="0.5" value="0" placeholder="jam">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="form-grid">
    <div class="form-row">
      <label>Jumlah hari Double Shift non-longshift (Shift 1 &amp; Shift 3, DUA presensi terpisah)</label>
      <input type="number" name="gapshift_count" min="0" value="0">
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <label>Double Shift - sesi ke-2 (Shift 3) sampai</label>
      <div class="mode-row">
        <label><input type="radio" name="gapshift_mode" value="full" checked> Full Shift 3 (sampai min_end_time)</label>
        <label><input type="radio" name="gapshift_mode" value="hours"> Sebagian, masuk Shift 3 selama</label>
        <input type="number" name="gapshift_hours" min="0" step="0.5" value="0" placeholder="jam">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="muted section-hint">
    Long Shift: clock_in di awal Shift 1, clock_out di akhir Shift 2 (atau cuma N jam masuk Shift 2 kalau
    pilih "Sebagian") - bukan presensi per-shift. Double Shift: 2 presensi independen hari yang sama
    (Shift 1 penuh + sesi Shift 3 - penuh atau cuma N jam, lompat Shift 2). Butuh shift bernama persis
    "Shift 1"/"Shift 2"/"Shift 3" aktif di company ini (di luar checklist Shift di atas). Diambil dari
    sisa hari kerja.
  </p>

  <div class="form-actions">
    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Generate</button>
  </div>
</form>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
<script src="/js/dummyAttendanceShift.js"></script>
